			"notes": "This is the first public build of Emergent Weaponry.\n\n- Adds the Potential mechanic, applied to vanilla weapons, tools, and armour\n- Adds the Modification Table to upgrade or transform items\n- Adds 3 variants of the Trident: the Inferno trident, the Frost trident, and the Essence trident\n\nThis is a pre-release build made for a public play-test of Emergent Weaponry. Expect balancing issues or occasional bugs, besides that the mod should be functional and fully playable.\n\n> Notice: After the first public play-test, a few issues have been found. Note that in this version, the mod doesn't function as well outside of Singleplayer. All bugs found in pre1 should be fixed in pre2."
